{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52211","headline":"颂六十二首 三十六 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 三十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄风冠西土，内范轶东矜。\n大川开宝匣，福地下金绳。\n绣松高可暎，画栱氎相承。\n日驭非难假，云师本易凭。\n阳楼疑难燧，阴轩类凿冰。\n迥题飞星没，长楣宿露凝。\n旌门曙光转，辇道夕云蒸。\n只桓多灵物，竹园满休徵。\n虚薄笔难纪，微驱窃自凌。\n优游从可恃，恩荫永难胜。\n（见同书卷五二《致敬部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}